+<body>
+<header class="wrap topbar"><a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Relay home"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>relay</a><nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="index.html">Product</a><a href="#compare">Compare</a><a class="login" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat">Talk to us</a></nav></header>
+<main>
+<section class="wrap intro"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</span><h1>Good work, within reach.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to stay in sync—without the noise, or the surprise invoice.</p><div class="billing"><div class="switch" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Billing frequency"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-period="monthly">Monthly</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-period="yearly">Yearly</button></div><span class="save">Save 20% yearly</span><span class="sr-only" id="billing-status" aria-live="polite">Prices shown monthly</span></div></section>
+<section class="wrap plans" aria-label="Plans">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="desc">A calmer way to chat, for any team.</p><div class="price"><strong>$0</strong><span>/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note">Free forever</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Start%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started</a><ul><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited messages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Up to 10 teammates</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>1:1 audio and video calls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>90-day message history</li></ul></article>
+<article class="plan featured"><span class="badge">MOST POPULAR</span><h2>Team</h2><p class="desc">The sweet spot for teams doing their best work.</p><div class="price"><strong data-monthly="8" data-yearly="6.4">$8</strong><span>/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note="team">Billed monthly</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Start%20with%20Relay%20Team">Choose Team</a><ul><li><span class="check">✓</span>Everything in Free</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited message history</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Group audio and video calls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited integrations</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Priority support</li></ul></article>
+<article class="plan"><h2>Business</h2><p class="desc">More control and confidence as you scale.</p><div class="price"><strong data-monthly="15" data-yearly="12">$15</strong><span>/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-note" data-note="business">Billed monthly</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Talk%20about%20Relay%20Business">Talk to sales</a><ul><li><span class="check">✓</span>Everything in Team</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Advanced admin controls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>SAML single sign-on</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Custom retention policies</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Dedicated success partner</li></ul></article>
