+<section class="wrap faq"><div class="section-head"><h2>A few good questions</h2><p>Still wondering? We’re happy to help.</p></div><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your needs change. Any price adjustment is applied to your next billing cycle.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and pay 20% less per user, per month. Your subscription is billed annually, and you can switch back to monthly at renewal.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my free trial ends?</summary><p>There’s no trial clock on Relay Free—it’s free for as long as you like. You only pay when you choose a paid plan.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel at any time?</summary><p>Yes. There are no contracts or cancellation fees. Your plan stays active through the end of the billing period you’ve paid for.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer discounts for nonprofits?</summary><p>We do. Get in touch at hello@relay.chat and tell us a little about your organization.</p></details></section>
+</main><footer class="wrap footer"><span>© 2025 Relay. Better together.</span><a href="mailto:hello@relay.chat">Questions? Say hello ↗</a></footer>
+<script>
+const options = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-period]')];
+options.forEach((button, index) => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+  const yearly = button.dataset.period === 'yearly';
+  options.forEach(option => option.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(option === button)));
+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-monthly]').forEach(price => price.textContent = '$' + price.dataset[yearly ? 'yearly' : 'monthly']);
+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-note]').forEach(note => note.textContent = yearly ? 'Billed annually' : 'Billed monthly');
+  document.getElementById('billing-status').textContent = `Prices shown ${yearly ? 'yearly' : 'monthly'}`;
+}));
+options.forEach((button, index) => button.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
+  if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' || event.key === 'ArrowRight') { event.preventDefault(); options[1-index].focus(); options[1-index].click(); }
+}));
+</script>
